00:18:38.174 --> 00:18:41.560
fairness among different
racial groups, etc.

00:18:41.561 --> 00:18:44.874
So these are things that one
would want to investigate and

00:18:44.875 --> 00:18:48.754
definitely not lose, right, when
moving to a different policy.

00:18:48.755 --> 00:18:53.186
So fairness really is up to
the user, to some extent,

00:18:53.187 --> 00:18:55.845
to define based on the context,

00:18:55.846 --> 00:19:00.190
what are some properties
that you'd be looking at.

00:19:00.191 --> 00:19:03.990
For example, in the context of
kidney transplantation, major

00:19:03.991 --> 00:19:08.340
issue has been that there has
been a severe organ shortages

00:19:08.341 --> 00:19:12.630
