whites, and they suffer from

00:19:17.461 --> 00:19:22.470
ISI far more frequently than
whites due to lifestyle reasons,

00:19:22.471 --> 00:19:26.890
and so fairness among different
races is of course critical.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:31.882
Your other question related
